# Pyramid Level 1 - The Outer Halls (biome: pyramid)
# Symbols: % = pyramid wall   . = stone floor   + = start
# Monster spawns: m = mummy
# Axis south-to-north: vestibule -> processional colonnade (three pillar
# pairs) -> the SERDAB, a sealed statue chamber with a single one-tile slot
# (15,11); a wooden chest waits inside. Behind it, the stair fan (14-16,4)
# with two guardian mummies. West wing: Hall of Offerings - a comb of five
# one-tile niches (x3, odd rows) for future decor/secrets, lectern shrine.
# East wing: Crypt Cells - six 2x2 burial cells, every one a secret slot.
# The wings meet the axis on the transverse gallery (y12).
